  ground: "clear — the black behind the cutouts was the scanner lid seen through a clear sheet, so every tier keys it to transparent; a page gives the piece its ground"
  alt_text: "Cutouts on a clear sheet: the lined-paper boat, I feel less stress daydreaming, pick a lens, the over and about window, in COLLEGE I studied Applied Learning Science, and a deep teal spiral square with two pink dots"
